        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n\nTWO BEDROOM APARTMENT IN DUBLIN 1\n\n\nRay Cooke Lettings are delighted to introduce this superb 2 bedroom apartment located in the vibrant heart of Dublin 1. Greeg Court is a quiet, secure and well-kept development positioned directly on Parnell Street, offering unrivalled convenience and excellent access to the city.\n\nThis bright and spacious property is presented in excellent condition throughout. The accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a generous living/dining area with a fitted kitchen, two bedrooms — one with a master ensuite — and a large main bathroom.\n\nThe location is positioned opposite the Rotunda Hospital and within walking distance of St. Stephen's Green, Grafton Street, Trinity College, the IFSC, Smithfield, Christ Church and The Four Courts. A fantastic selection of cafés, restaurants and bars are right on the doorstep, making this one of the most convenient and lively neighbourhoods in Dublin 1.\n\nTransport links are exceptional, with the LUAS Line at Jervis and Trinity, the DART at Tara Street, and numerous Dublin Bus routes all within minutes, providing easy access throughout the city and beyond.\n \n<u>Key Features:</u>\n<ul>\n <li>Spacious living accommodation</li>\n <li>Short walk to the Luas</li>\n <li>Bus routes at your doorstep</li>\n <li>LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION</li>\n</ul>\n\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE\n"
      },
      {
